          "status": "machine-unreviewed",
          "text": "Description: On September 27, 2009, a witness reported by email having seen during the night at 2:25 AM a particular luminous phenomenon. Observing through a window, they saw lights above their house. No noise was heard during the observation. The red and then green lights disappeared quickly. The witness did not wish to provide further explanations, making further investigation impossible. The case is therefore classified as C due to lack of information.",
